              "originalPosition": 26,
              "body": "This is something we can discuss further. Of course the life cycle will play a role on the protocol and can be put in the protocol document. However, the idea of adding this to architecture is to start the discussion on the lifecycle earlier and if agreed move this to protocol document.",
