            {
              "originalPosition": 41,
              "body": "```suggestion\n: A dialog stops exchanging messages while its dialog context is\n```",
              "createdAt": "2026-10-24T07:55:40Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-24T08:01:56Z"
            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 4,
              "body": "a) Figure: MODIFY is missing. Add a self-loop on ACTIVE.\nb) Authorization check: It applies to every lifecycle event (CMN-12), not only RESUME. \nc) RETIRE: Cancelling a task does not end the dialog (CMN-11). please use \u201cterminate\u201d instead of \u201cretire\u201d, to match the requirements.",
              "createdAt": "2026-10-24T07:59:07Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-24T08:01:56Z"
            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 41,
              "body": "\u201cBy agreement of the participants\u201d implies any participant can change the dialog. Lifecycle events should be made by an authorized participant (CMN-12).",
              "createdAt": "2026-10-24T07:59:59Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-24T08:01:56Z"
            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 36,
              "body": "The dialog context does not carry authorization or delegation context. Modification covers participants, modalities, and lifetime (CMN-11).\n",
              "createdAt": "2026-10-24T08:00:59Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-24T08:01:56Z"
            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 45,
              "body": "Being authenticated is not enough. The resuming party must be the participant whose exchange was interrupted, presenting the current dialog context (B1-7).",
              "createdAt": "2026-10-24T08:01:49Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-24T08:01:56Z"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
